	(text "Codec"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 25.4 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "3afbf48a-c5df-5b69-a26f-d297ae4340df")
	)
	(text "ES8311 at I2C address 0x18 (CE low). Master clock from the I2S bit clock by\ndefault (R30 fitted); for a real MCLK swap R30 for R31 (GPIO0, the only MCLK\npin of the classic ESP32). Placed by the board house."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 30.48 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "43c40364-11e1-5325-bc1d-49eaba9f09a0")
	)
	(text "Test points"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 231.4175 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "737ceb96-b395-5f15-adbc-60554ed33885")
	)
	(text "Receive"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 109.22 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "7b6579ec-df13-5b7f-a51c-a1b9264495ab")
	)
	(text "C37 blocks the bus DC. R34 and the BAT54S clamps catch the ~26 V steps of\nevery telegram. R35/R36 bias the node at mid-rail. Speech divides by about\n0.56 into the codec's 6 k input; the PGA sets the gain. High-pass ~150 Hz.\nCut JP2 to take the receive path off the bus."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 114.3 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "84056e32-8312-50b1-a7b3-30526f90fcf6")
	)
	(text "Current sink: the bus current through Q5 follows the voltage at TX_SUM divided\nby R42. TX_EN (GPIO4) ramps a DC bias of about 2.8 mA up over ~0.1 s, the\nDAC adds the speech on top. Off while TX_EN is low. Values provisional\nuntil the bus impedance is measured. Cut JP3 to take the stage off the bus."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 173.6325 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "a27bee9a-5742-54e8-bd0f-668cb38c389e")
	)
	(text "Send"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 168.5525 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "c916ea63-7aa8-539b-aeef-348a68a2766b")
	)
